// Hvigor's own configuration: the model version, again, and the one field it
// will not start without.
//
// It is the same string as `modelVersion` of the project's `oh-package.json5`
// because hvigor reads it out of both and compares: one of them missing, or the
// two of them different, is refused before a single task runs.
{
  "modelVersion": "5.1.0",
  "dependencies": {}
}
